[{"t0": 2.04, "t1": 102.98, "kind": "thinking", "text": "Let me create a complete website for \"Le Petit Four\" - a small French bakery. I'll create an index.html with embedded CSS and JavaScript, plus any additional files needed.\n\nLet me think about the design:\n- Hero section with name and tagline\n- Menu with at least 6 products and prices in euros\n- Opening hours\n- Contact form (name, email, message) with thank-you message without page reload\n- Responsive design for desktop and mobile\n- No external resources - no CDN, no web fonts, no images from the internet\n\nI'll use CSS for styling with a warm, bakery-like color scheme. I'll use SVG icons or CSS shapes instead of images.\n\nLet me create a single index.html file with all CSS and JS embedded.\n"}, {"t0": 5.74, "t1": 102.99, "kind": "tool", "tool": "write", "args": {"path": "index.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Le Petit Four - Boulangerie Artisanale</title>\n    <style>\n        /* ===== RESET & BASE ===== */\n        *, *::* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n            background: #fef9f0;\n            color: #5a3e2b;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n\n        img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }\n        a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n\n        /* ===== LAYOUT ===== */\n        .container {\n            max-width: 960px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ebd5b8;\n        }\n\n        section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }\n\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: \"Georgia\", \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n            color: #8b5a2b;\n        }\n\n        h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n        h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }\n        h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n\n        /* ===== HEADER ===== */\n        header {\n            background: #f8ede0;\n            border-bottom: 3px solid #d4a874;\n            padding: 0 0;\n        }\n\n        .header-inner {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            max-width: 960px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 16px 20px;\n        }\n\n        .logo {\n            font-size: 1.4rem;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #8b5a2b;\n            font-family: \"Georgia\", \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .nav-links {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 24px;\n            list-style: none;\n        }\n\n        .nav-links a {\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n            color: #5a3e2b;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            transition: color 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        .nav-links a:hover { color: #d4a874; }\n\n        /* ===== HERO ===== */\n        .hero {\n            background:\n                linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,250,230,0.9) 0%, rgba(255,250,230,0.6) 40%, rgba(255,250,230,0.9) 100%),\n                #fef9f0;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 100px 20px 80px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .hero h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);\n            color: #8b5a2b;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .hero .tagline {\n            font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);\n            color: #9a7555;\n            font-style: italic;\n            max-width: 500px;\n            margin: 0 auto 24px;\n        }\n\n        .hero .crumb {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 8px 20px;\n            background: #e8dcc8;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: #b88a60;\n            border: 1px solid #d4c4a8;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== MENU ===== */\n        .menu-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n            gap: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .menu-item {\n            background: #fff;\n            border: 1px solid #ebd5b8;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            padding: 20px;\n            transition: box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        .menu-item:hover {\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(139,90,43,0.08);\n            border-color: #d4a874;\n        }\n\n        .menu-item .item-name {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            font-size: 1.05rem;\n            color: #5a3e2b;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .menu-item .item-desc {\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            color: #9a7555;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .menu-item .item-price {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: #8b5a2b;\n            font-size: 1.1rem;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== HOURS ===== */\n        .hours-table {\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 500px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n        }\n\n        .hours-table th, .hours-table td {\n            padding: 10px 16px;\n            text-align: left;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ebd5b8;\n        }\n\n        .hours-table th {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: #8b5a2b;\n            width: 40%;\n        }\n\n        .hours-table td { color: #5a3e2b; }\n\n        .weekend {\n            background: #fef5e8;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== CONTACT FORM ===== */\n        .contact-form {\n            max-width: 500px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        .form-group {\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n        }\n\n        .form-group label {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            font-weight: 500;\n            color: #5a3e2b;\n            font-size: 0.95rem;\n        }\n\n        .form-group input,\n        .form-group textarea {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 12px 16px;\n            border: 1px solid #d4c4a8;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-family: inherit;\n            background: #fff;\n            color: #5a3e2b;\n            transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;\n        }\n\n        .form-group input:focus,\n        .form-group textarea:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: #d4a874;\n            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(212,168,116,0.2);\n        }\n\n        .form-group textarea {\n            min-height: 100px;\n            resize: vertical;\n        }\n\n        .submit-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background: #8b5a2b;\n            color: #fff;\n            border: none;\n            padding: 14px 32px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            font-size: 1rem;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .submit-btn:hover {\n            background: #a06b30;\n        }\n\n        .submit-btn:active {\n            transform: scale(0.98);\n        }\n\n        .thank-you {\n            display: none;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n            background: #f0ebe0;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            border: 1px solid #ebd5b8;\n        }\n\n        .thank-you.visible {\n            display: block;\n            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-out;\n        }\n\n        .thank-you p { color: #8b5a2b; font-size: 1.1rem; }\n\n        @keyframes fadeIn {\n            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }\n            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n        }\n\n        /* ===== FOOTER ===== */\n        footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 24px 20px;\n            background: #f8ede0;\n            color: #9a7555;\n            font-size: 0.85rem;\n            border-top: 3px solid #d4a874;\n        }\n\n        /* ===== MOBILE ===== */\n        @media (max-width: 640px) {\n            .header-inner {\n                flex-direction: column;\n                gap: 12px;\n            }\n\n            .nav-links {\n                gap: 16px;\n                flex-wrap: wrap;\n                justify-content: center;\n            }\n\n            .menu-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .hours-table th,\n            .hours-table td {\n                padding: 8px 12px;\n                font-size: 0.9rem;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <header>\n        <div class=\"header-inner\">\n            <div class=\"logo\">\n                <span aria-hidden=\"true\">🥐</span>\n                Le Petit Four\n            </div>\n            <nav>\n                <ul class=\"nav-links\">\n                    <li><a href=\"#menu\">Menu</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#hours\">Horaires</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Hero -->\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Le Petit Four</h1>\n            <p class=\"tagline\">Une boulangerie de quartier, où chaque croquette est faite avec amour et tradition.</p>\n            <span class=\"crumb\">🥖 Pâtisserie artisanale depuis 1985</span>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Menu -->\n    <section id=\"menu\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>🥐 Notre Menu</h2>\n            <div class=\"menu-grid\">\n                <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name\">Croissant au beurre</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-desc\">Beurre français, farine de blé tendre</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-price\">1,20 €</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name\">Pain au chocolat</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-desc\">Pâte feuilletée, chocolat noir 60%</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-price\">1,40 €</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name\">Pain de campagne</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-desc\">Farine complète, levain naturel</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-price\">2,00 €</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name\">Tarte aux pommes</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-desc\">Pâte brisée, pommes reinettes, sucre</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-price\">4,50 €</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name\">Canelés de Bordeaux</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-desc\">Rhum, canelle, beurre demi-sel</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-price\">2,20 €</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name\">Baguette tradition</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-desc\">Farine T55, levain, sel, eau</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-price\">1,00 €</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name\">Galette des rois</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-desc\">Pâte feuilletée, crème pâtissière, amande</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-price\">5,00 €</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name\">Éclairs au café</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-desc\">Choux, crème légère, glace café</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-price\">2,80 €</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Opening Hours -->\n    <section id=\"hours\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>🕐 Horaires d'ouverture</h2>\n            <table class=\"hours-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr><th>Jour</th><th>Heures</th></tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr><th> Lundi </th><td>07:30 — 19:30</td></tr>\n                    <tr><th> Mardi </th><td>07:30 — 19:30</td></tr>\n                    <tr><th> Mercredi </th><td>07:30 — 19:30</td></tr>\n                    <tr><th> Jeudi </th><td>07:30 — 19:30</td></tr>\n                    <tr><th> Vendredi </th><td>07:30 — 20:00</td></tr>\n                    <tr><th> Samedi </th><td class=\"weekend\">07:00 — 19:00</td></tr>\n                    <tr class=\"weekend\"><th> Dimanche </th><td class=\"weekend\">08:00 — 13:00</td></tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Contact -->\n    <section id=\"contact\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>✉️ Contactez-nous</h2>\n            <form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"contactForm\">\n                <div class=\"form-group\">\n                    <label for=\"name\">Nom</label>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Votre nom\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"form-group\">\n                    <label for=\"email\">Email</label>\n                    <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" required placeholder=\"votre@email.com\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"form-group\">\n                    <label for=\"message\">Message</label>\n                    <textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" required placeholder=\"Votre message...\"></textarea>\n                </div>\n                <button type=\"submit\" class=\"submit-btn\">Envoyer</button>\n            </form>\n            <div class=\"thank-you\" id=\"thankYou\">\n                <p>🎉 Merci ! Votre message a bien été envoyé. Nous vous répondrons sous 24h.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <p>&copy; 2024 Le Petit Four — 12 rue de la Boulangerie, 75011 Paris</p>\n            <p>Tel: 01 23 45 67 89</p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n            e.preventDefault();\n\n            const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();\n            const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();\n            const message = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();\n\n            if (!name || !email || !message) {\n                alert('Veuillez remplir tous les champs.');\n                return;\n            }\n\n            // Simple email format validation\n            const emailRegex = /^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/;\n            if (!emailRegex.test(email)) {\n                alert('Veuillez entrer une adresse email valide.');\n                return;\n            }\n\n            // Reset form and show thank-you\n            this.reset();\n            document.getElementById('thankYou').classList.add('visible');\n            document.querySelector('.submit-btn').style.display = 'none';\n        });\n\n        // Smooth scroll for anchor links\n        document.querySelectorAll('a[href^=\"#\"]').forEach(function (a) {\n            a.addEventListener('click', function () {\n                const id = this.getAttribute('href');\n                if (id === '#') return;\n                const el = document.querySelector(id);\n                if (el) {\n                    el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>"}, "result": "Successfully wrote to index.html", "error": false}, {"t0": 103.29, "t1": 105.03, "kind": "thinking", "text": "The file was written successfully. Let me verify it looks correct by reading it back.\n"}, {"t0": 103.9, "t1": 105.03, "kind": "tool", "tool": "read", "args": {"path": "index.html", "limit": 50}, "result": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fr\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Le Petit Four - Boulangerie Artisanale</title>\n    <style>\n        /* ===== RESET & BASE ===== */\n        *, *::* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n            background: #fef9f0;\n            color: #5a3e2b;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n\n        img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }\n        a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }\n\n        /* ===== LAYOUT ===== */\n        .container {\n            max-width: 960px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ebd5b8;\n        }\n\n        section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }\n\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: \"Georgia\", \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n            color: #8b5a2b;\n        }\n\n        h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n        h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }\n        h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; }\n\n        /* ===== HEADER ===== */\n        header {\n  